<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾳδιουργ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>doing things easily</i>,
			only in bad sense, <i>unscrupulous, reckless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. εἶναι ἐν τοῖς λόγοις καὶ ἐν τοῖς
					ἔργοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>VV</u>
					1251a20
				</span></i>
			: as Subst., <i>knave, rogue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.29.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				2.292.9
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.602a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.22.93
			</span></i>; esp. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλαστογράφος</span>,
				<i>forger</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁγνός</span>, <i>impure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίαι -ότεραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					8.9
				</span></i>
			: Adv.
			
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον</span> in this sense, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.5.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
